            <div><strong>Caja de Ahorro BROU:</strong> <span class="font-mono font-bold text-primary select-all">110975226-00001</span></div>
            <div><strong>Redes (Abitab / Redpagos):</strong> <span class="font-mono font-bold text-primary select-all">601-0551790</span></div>
            <div class="pt-1 text-[11px] text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-200">
